{"ID":"20240506082125-6zl1xt5","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240506082125-6zl1xt5","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240506082125-6zl1xt5\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240627082447-lxs7ko4\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240612131631-bcgu8zx\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240627094235-oq4dv4l\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:3,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:3\u0026#125;","title":"236蛴螬","type":"doc","updated":"20240821161719"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240627082447-lxs7ko4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240627082447-lxs7ko4","updated":"20240627082447"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 402px;","style":"width: 392px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"蛴螬"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/蛴螬-20240627082447-2ztqsyf.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 392px;\" parent-style=\"width: 402px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240821161441-cgd24aq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240821161441-cgd24aq","updated":"20240821161442"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 403px;","style":"width: 393px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"金龟子6"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/金龟子6-20240627094235-xs82suf.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 393px;\" parent-style=\"width: 403px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240627084407-20736fe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240627084407-20736fe","updated":"20240821161435"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 599px;","style":"width: 589px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"蛴螬2"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/蛴螬2-20240627084405-bapmo75.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 589px;\" parent-style=\"width: 599px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 573px;","style":"width: 563px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"蛴螬3"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/蛴螬3-20240627084407-rn6dd6v.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 563px;\" parent-style=\"width: 573px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240821161550-5ca2oih","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240821161550-5ca2oih","updated":"20240821161846"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 601px;","style":"width: 591px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"蛴螬"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/蛴螬-20240821161550-9z03ync.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 591px;\" parent-style=\"width: 601px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 600px;","style":"width: 590px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"蛴螬 (2)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/蛴螬 2-20240821161846-mshfkz1.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 590px;\" parent-style=\"width: 600px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240627094134-bct2mgn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240627094134-bct2mgn","updated":"20240821161856"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 750px;","style":"width: 740px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"金龟子蛹"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/金龟子蛹-20240627094134-hcudz0s.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 740px;\" parent-style=\"width: 750px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 358px;","style":"width: 348px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"蛴螬 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/蛴螬 1-20240821161659-zkbqayf.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 348px;\" parent-style=\"width: 358px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240627082932-pjdafr1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240627082932-pjdafr1","updated":"20240821161719"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 319px;","style":"width: 309px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"金龟子"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/金龟子-20240627082932-6xyht43.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 309px;\" parent-style=\"width: 319px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 347px;","style":"width: 337px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"金龟子2"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/金龟子2-20240627083151-kfd6p6h.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 337px;\" parent-style=\"width: 347px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 390px;","style":"width: 380px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"金龟子3"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/金龟子3-20240627083350-toqfdgf.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 380px;\" parent-style=\"width: 390px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240627083218-nql9ry9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240627083218-nql9ry9","updated":"20240627083224"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"注：蛴螬为金龟子幼虫。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131801-ha1ofla","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612131801-ha1ofla"}},{"ID":"20240612131813-v2weoaz","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612131813-v2weoaz","updated":"20240612131817"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蛴螬《神农本草经》"}]},{"ID":"20240612131813-eil7cq9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131813-eil7cq9","updated":"20240612131813"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味咸微温。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131813-oawk990","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131813-oawk990","updated":"20240612131813"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主恶血，血淤，（《御览》作血瘴）痹气，破折血在胁下坚满痛，月闭，目中淫肤，青翳，白膜。一名蟦蛴。生平泽。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131813-qmi9xcy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131813-qmi9xcy","updated":"20240612131813"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《名医》曰：一名蜰齐，一名勃齐，生河内人家积粪草中，取无时，反行者，良。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131813-16s3vis","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131813-16s3vis","updated":"20240612131813"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"案《说文》云：（齐内去二加虫）、（齐内去二加虫）（上曹下虫虫）也，蝤，蝤（齐内去二加虫）也，蝎、蝤（齐内去二加虫）也。《广雅》云：蛭蛒，（上关下虫）（虫属），地蚕，蠹蟦，蛴螬。《尔雅》云：蟦、蛴螬。郭璞云：在粪土中，又蝤蛴，蝎。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131813-z5bjkw8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131813-z5bjkw8","updated":"20240612131813"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"郭璞云：在木中，今虽通名蝎，所在异，又蝎，蛣（虫屈）。郭璞云：木中蠹虫，蝎、桑蠹。郭璞云：即拮掘。《毛诗》云：领如蝤蛴。《传》云：蝤蛴，蝎虫也。方言云：蛴螬，谓之蟦，自关而东，谓之蝤蛴，或谓之蚕蠋，或谓之蚕蠋，梁益之间，谓之蛒，或谓之蝎或谓之蛭蛒，秦晋之间，谓之蠹，或谓之天蝼。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131813-oa706ao","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131813-oa706ao","updated":"20240612131813"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"列子天瑞篇云：乌足根为蛴螬。《博物志》云：蛴螬以背行，快于足用，《说文》无蟦字，当借蜰为之，声相近，字之误也。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131856-w72tkck","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612131856-w72tkck"}},{"ID":"20240612131857-zp5kgkk","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612131857-zp5kgkk","updated":"20240612131902"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蛴螬《本草衍义》"}]},{"ID":"20240612131857-wy56dik","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131857-wy56dik","updated":"20240612131857"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"此虫诸腐木根下有之。构木津甘，故根下多有此虫，其木身未有完者。亦有生于粪土中者，虽肥大，但腹中黑，不若木中者，虽瘦而稍白。生研，水绞汁，滤清饮，下奶。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131944-y34u0i3","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612131944-y34u0i3"}},{"ID":"20240612131945-75z3qe4","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612131945-75z3qe4","updated":"20240612131950"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蛴螬《汤液本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240612131945-4bfdysw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131945-4bfdysw","updated":"20240612131945"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"微寒，微温，味咸。有毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131945-jpnj9k4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131945-jpnj9k4","updated":"20240612131945"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本草》云∶主恶血血瘀，痹气破折，血在胁下，坚满痛，月闭，目中淫肤，青翳白膜。吐血，在胸中不去，及破骨 折血结。金疮血塞。产后中寒，下乳汁。仲景治杂病方，大黄虫丸中用之，以其主胁下坚满也。《续传信方》治喉痹，取虫汁点在喉中，下即喉开也。《时习》补入。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131846-n3i3ogh","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612131846-n3i3ogh"}},{"ID":"20240612131906-82rf6bv","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612131906-82rf6bv","updated":"20240612131915"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蛴螬《本草思辨录》"}]},{"ID":"20240612131906-m66u4m6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131906-m66u4m6","updated":"20240612131906"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蛴螬生于粪壤，粪壤犹人身之恶血；迨其变蝉，则吸风饮露，最为清洁，犹人身之目不容纤尘。故其破瘀血，则蛴螬之出于粪壤也。主目中淫肤青翳白膜，则蛴之变蝉，化秽浊为清洁也。仲景 虫丸，正以其两目黯黑而用之，然虚劳而非有血瘀者不宜。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131923-07xtkgq","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612131923-07xtkgq"}},{"ID":"20240612131924-3z2bagz","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612131924-3z2bagz","updated":"20240612131924"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蛴螬"}]},{"ID":"20240612131924-8og08zy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131924-8og08zy","updated":"20240612131924"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"咸微寒有毒，治血瘀、痹气胁下坚满、破折、金疮，下乳疗目疾，以背反行者真。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131907-vdtcglo","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612131907-vdtcglo"}},{"ID":"20240612131847-1w23gvy","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612131847-1w23gvy","updated":"20240612131851"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蛴螬《神农本草经赞》"}]},{"ID":"20240612131847-mkcww7b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131847-mkcww7b","updated":"20240612131847"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味咸微温。主恶血血瘀。痹气。破折血在胁下坚满痛。月闭。目中淫肤。青翳白膜。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131847-q361yuj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131847-q361yuj","updated":"20240612131847"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一名蛴。生平泽。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131847-9dgcxa9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131847-9dgcxa9","updated":"20240612131847"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"不母而生。偻俯。湿郁根株。热蒸粪土。变食还明。杂羹通乳。莫误蝤蛴。殊形柳腐。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131847-t4nxeu8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131847-t4nxeu8","updated":"20240612131847"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"李时珍曰。宋齐邱言。蛴螬不母而生。久则羽化。其状如蚕。生树根及粪土中。皆湿热之气熏蒸而化。言者。其状肥也。晋书传。中书郎盛冲母王氏失明。婢取蛴螬蒸熟与食。母目即开。陶弘景曰。同猪蹄作羹食。下乳汁。苏恭曰。一名蝤蛴。生腐柳中。韩保升曰。以木中所生者为胜。生产既殊。主疗亦别。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131836-kji5p77","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612131836-kji5p77"}},{"ID":"20240612131837-pdk3jh5","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612131837-pdk3jh5","updated":"20240612131842"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蛴螬《本经逢原》"}]},{"ID":"20240612131837-ebwlwdr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131837-ebwlwdr","updated":"20240612131837"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"咸微温有毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131837-eaqefh9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131837-eaqefh9","updated":"20240612131837"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本经》主恶血血瘀痹气，破折血在胁下坚满，通月闭，目中淫肤，青翳白膜。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131837-0ol1zp2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131837-0ol1zp2","updated":"20240612131837"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"发明"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蛴螬穴土而居，与蚯蚓不异，故《本经》所治皆瘀血之证。《金匮》治虚劳瘀血，大黄 虫丸方用之，取其去胁下坚满也。许学士治筋急，养血地黄丸用之，亦取其治血瘀也。取汁滴目去翳障散血止痛。《千金》研末敷小儿脐疮，加猪脂调治小儿唇紧，《经验方》治瘀伤肿痛。《肘后》捣涂竹木刺。苏颂捣汁点喉痹得下即开。藏器涂游风丹疹。又治麦芒入眼，以蛴螬在目上隔布摩之，芒着布上即出。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131822-mszhv5l","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612131822-mszhv5l"}},{"ID":"20240612131823-nu0r9oi","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612131823-nu0r9oi","updated":"20240612131829"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蛴螬《本草述钩元》"}]},{"ID":"20240612131823-s1zny01","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131823-s1zny01","updated":"20240612131823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一名地蚕。其状如蚕而大。身短节促。足长有毛。生树根及粪土。中者。外黄内黑。生旧茅屋上者。外白内黯。宋齐邱谓燥湿相育。不母而生。久则羽化去。按蛴螬或误以为蝤蛴。又误以为蝎为蠹。不知此三种。皆出朽木中。而蛴螬则粪土中所生也。王充论衡。蛴螬化腹。腹拆背出而为蝉。然则腹即蝉蜕也。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131823-of5zdcv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131823-of5zdcv","updated":"20240612131823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味咸。气微温。微寒。有毒。主恶血血瘀。破折血在胁下坚满痛。虚劳干血。血结筋挛。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131823-j34nmu8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131823-j34nmu8","updated":"20240612131823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"血取还知〔论〕蛴螬生于粪土中。本阴气而味咸。故入血分。其展转相化无母而生。（湿气所蕴。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131823-wjl2m4w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131823-wjl2m4w","updated":"20240612131823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"相育黄丸未得例〔修治〕诸方有干研。及生取汁之不同。临用酌之。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131802-xopmkxa","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612131802-xopmkxa"}},{"ID":"20240612131803-d06kfdy","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612131803-d06kfdy","updated":"20240612131807"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蛴螬《本草纲目》"}]},{"ID":"20240612131803-auejm9c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131803-auejm9c","updated":"20240612131803"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「释名」地蚕、乳齐、应条。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131803-92os8m2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131803-92os8m2","updated":"20240612131803"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「气味」咸、微温、有毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131803-qocuqlm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131803-qocuqlm","updated":"20240612131803"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「主治」"}]},{"ID":"20240612131803-j6xlu8u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131803-j6xlu8u","updated":"20240612131803"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、小儿脐疮。用蛴螬研末敷涂。数次可愈。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131803-dtcqezx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131803-dtcqezx","updated":"20240612131803"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、小儿唇紧。用蛴螬研末，猪油调搽。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131803-9xv3pzn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131803-9xv3pzn","updated":"20240612131803"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3、丹毒。用蛴螬捣烂敷涂。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131803-wxithv9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131803-wxithv9","updated":"20240612131803"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4、痈疽痔漏。用蛴螬研末敷涂。每天一次。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131803-ujadjc5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131803-ujadjc5","updated":"20240612131803"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5、断酒不饮，用蛴螬研末，酒送服。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131803-a9y9rd4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131803-a9y9rd4","updated":"20240612131803"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6、目中翳障。有蛴螬捣取滇，滴眼中。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131621-jpxmafc","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612131621-jpxmafc"}},{"ID":"20240612131751-o80rixn","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612131751-o80rixn","updated":"20240612131756"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蛴螬《证类本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240612131751-go2y6hs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131751-go2y6hs","updated":"20240612131751"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味咸，微温、微寒，有毒。主恶血，血瘀痹气，破折血在胁下坚满痛，月闭，目中淫肤，青翳白膜，疗吐血在胸腹不去及破骨 折，血结，金疮内塞，产后中寒，下乳汁。一名（扶文切）蛴，一名KT （音肥）齐，一名 齐。生河内平泽及人家积粪草中。取无时，反行者陶隐居云∶大者如足大指，以背行，乃快于脚，杂猪蹄作羹，与乳母不能别之。《诗》云∶领如蝤蛴，今此别之，名以蛴字在下，恐此云此蛴螬倒尔。唐本注云∶此虫有在粪聚，或在腐木中。其在腐柳树中者，内外洁白；土粪中者，皮黄内黑黯。形色既异，土木又殊，当以木中者为胜。采虽无时，亦宜取冬月为佳。按《尔雅》一名蝎（音曷），一名 ，一名蝤蛴。今按陈藏器本草云∶蛴螬，主赤白游疹。以物发疹破碎，蛴螬取汁涂之。臣禹锡等谨按蜀本注云∶今据《尔雅》 ，蛴螬。注云∶在粪土中。《本经》亦云∶一名 蛴。又云∶生积诸朽树中蠹虫，俗通谓之蝎，莫如其主疗，唯桑树中者，近方∶用用未识部虫类中，有桑蠹一条云∶味甘，无毒。主心暴痛，金疮肉生不足，即此是也。苏云∶当以木中者为胜，今独谓其不然者，谓生出既殊，主疗亦别。虽有毒，无毒易见，而相使、相恶难知。又蝎不共号蛴螬， 不兼名 ，几以处疗，当自审之也。药性论云∶蛴螬，臣。汁，主滴目中，去翳障。主血止痛。日华子云∶蛴螬虫，治胸下坚满，障翳瘀膜，治风疹。桑、柳树内收者佳，余处即不中。粪土中者，可敷恶疮。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131751-qzwive5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131751-qzwive5","updated":"20240612131751"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"图经曰∶蛴螬，生河内平泽及人家积粪草中，今处处有之。大者有如足大指，以背行反快于脚，采无时。反行者良。此《尔雅》所谓 ，蛴螬。郭璞云∶在粪土中者是也。而诸朽木中蠹虫，形亦相似，但洁白于粪土中者，即《尔雅》所云∶蝤蛴，蝎。又云∶蝎， 。又云∶蝎，桑虫。郭云∶在木中虽通名蝎，所在异者是此也。苏恭以谓入药当用木中者，乃与《本经》云生积粪草中相戾矣。有名未用中，自有桑虫条。桑虫即 也，与此主疗殊别。今医家与蓐妇下乳药用之，乃是掘粪土中者，其效殊速。乃知苏说未可据也。张仲景治杂病方，大虫丸中用蛴螬，以其主胁下坚满也。《续传信方》治喉痹，取虫汁点在喉中，下即喉开也。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131751-nhl0vro","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131751-nhl0vro","updated":"20240612131751"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"陈藏器《本经》云∶生粪土中。陶云∶能背行者。苏云∶在腐木中，柳木中者皮白，粪中者皮黄，以木中者为胜。按∶蛴螬居粪土中，身短足长，背有毛筋。但从水入秋，蜕为蝉，飞空饮露，能鸣高洁。蝎在朽木中，食木心，穿如锥刀。一名蠹，身长足短，口黑无毛，节慢。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131751-1saivga","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131751-1saivga","updated":"20240612131751"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"至春羽化为天牛，两角状如水牛，色黑背有白点，上下缘木，飞腾不遥。二虫出处既殊，形质又别，苏乃混其状，总名蛴螬，异乎蔡谟彭蜞，几为所误。苏敬此注，乃千虑一失矣。《尔雅》云∶ ，蛴蝤，蛴蝎。郭注云∶蛴螬在粪土中，蝎在木中，桑蠹是也。饰通名蝎，所在异也。又云∶啮桑，注云∶似蝎牛，长角，有白点，喜啮桑树作孔也。雷公云∶凡使，桑树、柏树中者妙。凡收得后阴干，干后与糯米同炒，待米焦黑为度，然后去米，取之，去口畔并身上肉毛并黑尘了，作三、四截，碾成粉用之。外台秘要∶《删繁》丹走皮中浸淫，名火丹。方∶取蛴螬末敷之。千金方∶治稻、麦芒入眼。取蛴螬，以新布覆目上，持蛴螬从布上摩之秘录∶治痈疽，痔漏，恶疮及小儿丹。末蛴螬敷上。治口疮截头箸，翻过拭疮，效。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131751-yx3r3jn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131751-yx3r3jn","updated":"20240612131751"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"衍义曰∶蛴螬，此虫诸腐木根下有之。构木津甘，故根下多有此虫，其木身未有完者。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131751-pwndr4l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131751-pwndr4l","updated":"20240612131751"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"亦有生于粪土中者，虽肥大，但腹中黑，不若木中者，虽瘦而稍白。生研，水绞汁，滤清饮，下奶。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131621-tfagqov","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612131621-tfagqov"}},{"ID":"20240612131738-ow7np8a","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612131738-ow7np8a","updated":"20240612131743"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蛴螬《医学入门》"}]},{"ID":"20240612131738-exr1u8v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131738-exr1u8v","updated":"20240612131738"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蛴螬咸温在桑枯，瘀闭胁坚不可无，汁点眼翳开喉痹，木刺痛疮碎捣敷。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131738-amhm1x5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131738-amhm1x5","updated":"20240612131738"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蛴，齐也，无头尾之分；螬，曹也，曹曹踊动貌。无毒。主破恶瘀在胸腹不去、吐血，通月经血闭，下乳汁，破骨 折、血在胁下、坚满疼痛。汁点目中淫肤、青翳、白膜，点喉痹止痛消肿。竹木刺入肉，捣碎敷之立出。痈疽痔 ，赤白游风，丹疹，取汁涂之。生桑柳树中内外洁白者佳，生积粪中者，皮黄色暗，止可敷疮疽。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131738-zs5rw7y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131738-zs5rw7y","updated":"20240612131738"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"冬月或临时采，阴干，糯米同炒，米焦黑取出，去口畔并身上肉毛黑尘，作三四截研粉用。蜚蠊为使。治禾芒入目，以新布覆目上，持蛴螬从布上摩之，其芒自出。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131621-pj775o3","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612131621-pj775o3"}},{"ID":"20240612131728-a7515v7","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612131728-a7515v7","updated":"20240612131733"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蛴螬《新修本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240612131728-q58go7q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131728-q58go7q","updated":"20240612131728"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味咸，微温、微寒，有毒。主恶血，血瘀痹气，破折血在胁下坚满痛，月闭，目中淫肤、青翳白膜。疗吐血在胸腹不去，及破骨 折，血结，金疮内塞，产后中寒，下乳汁。一名蛴，一名肥齐，一名勃齐。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131728-s1cnan3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131728-s1cnan3","updated":"20240612131728"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生河内平泽及人家积粪草中。取无时，反行者良。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131728-wlsyjpr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131728-wlsyjpr","updated":"20240612131728"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蜚蠊为之使，恶附子。大者如足大指，以背滚行，乃驶于脚，杂猪蹄作羹与乳母，不能别之。诗云领如蝤蛴，今此别之。名以蛴字在下，恐此云蛴螬倒尔。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131728-zc5y7gg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131728-zc5y7gg","updated":"20240612131728"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〔谨案〕此虫，有在粪聚中，或在腐木中。其在腐柳树中者，内外洁白；土粪中者，皮黄内黑黯。形色既异，土木又殊，当以木中者为胜。采虽无时，亦宜取冬月为佳。案《尔雅》∶一名蝎，一名 ，一名蝤蛴。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131621-h771o3j","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612131621-h771o3j"}},{"ID":"20240612131629-0te4gxq","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612131629-0te4gxq","updated":"20240612131629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《全国中草药汇编》：蛴螬"}]},{"ID":"20240612131629-7altm41","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131629-7altm41","updated":"20240612131629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240612131629-5tkw9oh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131629-5tkw9oh","updated":"20240612131629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Qí Cáo"}]},{"ID":"20240612131629-q09vspv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131629-q09vspv","updated":"20240612131629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240612131629-cxjrslp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131629-cxjrslp","updated":"20240612131629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 粪虫、地蚕"}]},{"ID":"20240612131629-hz1vplj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131629-hz1vplj","updated":"20240612131629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240612131629-8fwuo6f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131629-8fwuo6f","updated":"20240612131629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 金龟甲科昆虫"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"朝鲜金龟甲"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Holotrichia diomphalia Bates或"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"铜绿金龟甲"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Anomala carpulenta Motsch.以"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"幼虫体"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"入药。一般于5～8月间在树根、草根近处1～2寸的土中生长，翻土捕捉，开水烫死，晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131629-5fsxi4r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131629-5fsxi4r","updated":"20240612131629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240612131629-ogmhy43","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131629-ogmhy43","updated":"20240612131629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 咸，微温。有毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131629-qfeu1g1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131629-qfeu1g1","updated":"20240612131629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240612131629-hoci2oe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131629-hoci2oe","updated":"20240612131629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 破瘀血，消肿止痛，明目。用于丹毒，痈肿，痔漏，目翳。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131629-wwcss9e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131629-wwcss9e","updated":"20240612131629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240612131629-mssaquz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131629-mssaquz","updated":"20240612131629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 3～5分；外用适量，捣烂敷患处或取汁点眼。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131629-d4i9b38","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131629-d4i9b38","updated":"20240612131629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"备注"}]},{"ID":"20240612131629-vgr82n8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131629-vgr82n8","updated":"20240612131629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" （1）东北地区尚有一种"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"蛴螬"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，其原昆虫为"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"金龟甲"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Mimela lucidula Hope。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131629-orcrg78","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131629-orcrg78","updated":"20240612131629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240612131629-w9vipdu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131629-w9vipdu","updated":"20240612131629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《全国中草药汇编》"}]},{"ID":"20240612131629-4ccam45","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612131629-4ccam45","updated":"20240612131629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中药大辞典》：蛴螬"}]},{"ID":"20240612131629-3eg9cpx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131629-3eg9cpx","updated":"20240612131629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240612131629-29p7bkc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131629-29p7bkc","updated":"20240612131629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Qí Cáo"}]},{"ID":"20240612131629-8vqvddv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131629-8vqvddv","updated":"20240612131629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240612131629-n7pluie","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131629-n7pluie","updated":"20240612131629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 蟦（《尔雅》），蟦蛴（《本经》），应条（《吴普本草》），地蚕（郭璞），蜰齐、敦齐（《别录》），乳齐（陶弘景），土蚕（《安徽药材》），老母虫（《四川中药志》），核桃虫（《药材学》）。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131629-42a5bf6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131629-42a5bf6","updated":"20240612131629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240612131629-2ecny3y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131629-2ecny3y","updated":"20240612131629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《本经》"}]},{"ID":"20240612131629-v0sgn69","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131629-v0sgn69","updated":"20240612131629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240612131629-qymwmcd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131629-qymwmcd","updated":"20240612131629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 为金龟子科昆虫"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"朝鲜黑金龟子"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"或其他近缘昆虫的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"干燥幼虫"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。5～8月间翻土捕捉，捕得后用沸水烫死，晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131629-ix5okq2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131629-ix5okq2","updated":"20240612131629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生境分布"}]},{"ID":"20240612131629-jtslvb5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131629-jtslvb5","updated":"20240612131629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 本种分布很广，从黑龙江起至长江以南地区以及内蒙古、陕西等地均有。产江苏、安徽、四川、河北、山东、河南和东北等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131629-h9jdi1r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131629-h9jdi1r","updated":"20240612131629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原形态"}]},{"ID":"20240612131629-9y1p8fm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131629-9y1p8fm","updated":"20240612131629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 体呈长椭圆形，长16～21毫米，阔8～11毫米。黑褐色，有光泽，被有黄褐色的细毛。触角黄褐色，10节，呈膝状弯曲。前胸背板有刻点；翅鞘上有数条隆起的暗纹。足3对，甚长。幼虫（蛴螬）长约35毫米，乳白色，体常弯曲，密生黄白色细毛，胸部3节，各有发达的胸足1对，足上密生棕褐色细毛。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131629-juf4mzs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131629-juf4mzs","updated":"20240612131629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"成虫栖于田土中，昼伏夜出，6月中旬至7月下旬成群出现，至10月上旬绝迹。麦收前，多在麦和向日葵上交尾，取食；夏播后转至大豆和粟上交尾，取食。雌虫交尾后产卵于土中，旋即死亡。蛴螬生活于3～6厘米深的土内，咬食作物的根部。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131629-yz1chok","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131629-yz1chok","updated":"20240612131629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状"}]},{"ID":"20240612131629-ms6uw6q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131629-ms6uw6q","updated":"20240612131629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 干燥的幼虫呈长圆柱形或弯曲成扁肾形，长约2厘米，宽1～1.2厘米。棕黄色、棕褐色或黄白色。全体有环节，头部小，棕褐色，体壳较硬而脆，体内呈空泡状，气微臭。以干燥、色黄、条大、完整者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131629-0588n2y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131629-0588n2y","updated":"20240612131629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药理作用"}]},{"ID":"20240612131629-m87deas","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131629-m87deas","updated":"20240612131629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 蛴螬水浸液1：1000以上能兴奋离体兔子宫；1：100能抑制寓体兔肠管。1：10000浓度对兔冠状血管、离体兔耳血管、蟾蜍肺血管皆有收缩作用；更高浓度（1：1000以上）还能收缩蟾蜍内脏血管。大剂量有利尿作用，但对血压无影响（急性兔试验）。1：1000浓度能兴奋离体心脏，浓度更高则导致舒张期停止。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131629-emdxxo4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131629-emdxxo4","updated":"20240612131629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炮制"}]},{"ID":"20240612131629-llm3q2z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131629-llm3q2z","updated":"20240612131629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 筛去泥土，洗净晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131629-6j32t3o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131629-6j32t3o","updated":"20240612131629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《雷公炮炙论》：\"阴干后与糯米同炒，待米焦黑为度。去口畔并身上肉毛，作三、四截，碾成粉用之。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612131629-ame1xmd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131629-ame1xmd","updated":"20240612131629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240612131629-80zzjh2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131629-80zzjh2","updated":"20240612131629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《本草汇言》：\"入足厥阴肝经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612131629-c3y4x99","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131629-c3y4x99","updated":"20240612131629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240612131629-ofp4y7m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131629-ofp4y7m","updated":"20240612131629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①《本经》：\"味咸，微温。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612131629-z6k1n2w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131629-z6k1n2w","updated":"20240612131629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《别录》：\"微寒，有毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612131629-eh9aq93","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131629-eh9aq93","updated":"20240612131629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意"}]},{"ID":"20240612131629-gec4pe0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131629-gec4pe0","updated":"20240612131629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《本草经集注》：\"蜚虻（一作\"蜚蠊\"）为之使。恶附子。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612131629-609y3r9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131629-609y3r9","updated":"20240612131629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240612131629-k807cob","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131629-k807cob","updated":"20240612131629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 破血，行瘀，散结，通乳。治折损瘀痛，痛风，破伤风，喉痹，目翳，丹毒，痈疽，痔漏。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131629-02zavor","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131629-02zavor","updated":"20240612131629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本经》：\"主恶血血瘀痹气，破折血在胁下坚满痛，月闭，目中淫肤、青翳白膜。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612131629-0d6z4yt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131629-0d6z4yt","updated":"20240612131629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《别录》：\"疗吐血在胸腹不去及破骨踒折血结，金疮内塞，产后中寒，下乳汁。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612131629-n1cr57n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131629-n1cr57n","updated":"20240612131629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《药性论》：\"汁滴目中，去翳障，主血，止痛。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612131629-9d6nntr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131629-9d6nntr","updated":"20240612131629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《本草拾遗》：\"主赤白游疹，疹擦破，碎蛴螬取汁涂之。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612131629-awyd3q8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131629-awyd3q8","updated":"20240612131629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤《日华子本草》：\"可敷恶疮。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612131629-khd107t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131629-khd107t","updated":"20240612131629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240612131629-mmsrrsl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131629-mmsrrsl","updated":"20240612131629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服：入丸、散。外用：研末调敷或捣敷。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131629-1bnoxox","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131629-1bnoxox","updated":"20240612131629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"复方"}]},{"ID":"20240612131629-d4sievm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131629-d4sievm","updated":"20240612131629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①治白虎风疼痛，昼静夜发：蛴螬七枚（研烂），甘草（炙，末，炒）五钱，没药（研）、乳香（研）各炒一钱。上四味同研烂，分二服，每服煎酒一盏，二、三沸，调下，不计时。（《圣济总录》蛴螬散）"}]},{"ID":"20240612131629-qjk2hor","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131629-qjk2hor","updated":"20240612131629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②治破伤风：蛴螬虫一个，将脊背捏住，俟它口中吐水，就擦抹在疮口上，觉麻，身上汗出。（《婴童百问》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612131629-vuer2hz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131629-vuer2hz","updated":"20240612131629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③治喉痹：蛴螬汁，点喉中。（《续传信方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612131629-sppdzhz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131629-sppdzhz","updated":"20240612131629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④治痈疽痔漏恶疮及小儿丹：末蛴螬敷上。（《子母秘录》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612131629-qwvrmdz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131629-qwvrmdz","updated":"20240612131629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤治沈唇：干蛴螬烧末，和猪脂，临卧敷之。（《千金方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612131629-57qxzmw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131629-57qxzmw","updated":"20240612131629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"临床应用"}]},{"ID":"20240612131629-zscr1a3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131629-zscr1a3","updated":"20240612131629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 治疗破伤风：将蛴螬倒置（头向下），让其自然吐出黄水（如急用，可剪去蛴螬尾，黄水随即流出）。取黄水搽在伤口上（可使伤口麻木，身上出汗）；重症者可将黄水滴入酒中，炖热内服，以使出汗；牙关紧闭者，可用蛴螬水涂擦牙龈。亦可将蛴螬捣烂如泥，外敷伤口，干后即换；或以蛴螬10个，焙干为末，分2次用黄酒送服（小儿酌减）。上述方法每多合并使用。经治14例，结果痊愈11例，死亡3例。有效病例均在15～30分钟张口自如，喉痉挛消失或减轻，口腔分泌物显着减少，能吞咽食物和药物。服药后抽搐虽能减轻，但尚不能制止，仍需配合其他方法治疗。3例死亡者均因年老体弱，并有心肺功能不良。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131629-1hkuszs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131629-1hkuszs","updated":"20240612131629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"各家论述"}]},{"ID":"20240612131629-iebmp2n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131629-iebmp2n","updated":"20240612131629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①《纲目》：蛴螬，\"《本事方》治筋急，养血地黄丸中用之，取其治血瘀痹也。陈氏《经验方》云：盛冲母失明，取蛴螬蒸熟食，目即开。与《本经》治目中青翳白膜，《药性论》汁滴目中去翳障之说相合。《婴童百问》治破伤风，又符疗踒折、敷恶疮、金疮内塞、主血、止痛之说也。盖此药能行血分，散结滞，故能治以上诸病。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612131629-fd7i6w6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131629-fd7i6w6","updated":"20240612131629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《长沙药解》：\"蛴螬，能化瘀血，最消症块。《金匮》大黄蟅虫丸用之，治虚劳腹满，内有干血，以其破瘀而化积也。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612131629-kqg00u4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131629-kqg00u4","updated":"20240612131629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240612131629-9jvvd19","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131629-9jvvd19","updated":"20240612131629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中药大辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240612131629-n2e173b","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612131629-n2e173b","updated":"20240612131629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中华本草》：蛴螬"}]},{"ID":"20240612131629-jv2m7xq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131629-jv2m7xq","updated":"20240612131629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240612131629-ndz5yv5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131629-ndz5yv5","updated":"20240612131629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Qí Cáo"}]},{"ID":"20240612131629-94p3wqd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131629-94p3wqd","updated":"20240612131629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240612131629-c3a0aoh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131629-c3a0aoh","updated":"20240612131629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 蟦、蟦蛴、应条、地蚕、蜰齐、乳齐、土蚕、老母虫、核桃虫"}]},{"ID":"20240612131629-96n7x0j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131629-96n7x0j","updated":"20240612131629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"英文名"}]},{"ID":"20240612131629-854mk41","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131629-854mk41","updated":"20240612131629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Northeast Giant Black Chafer"}]},{"ID":"20240612131629-4r0aiva","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131629-4r0aiva","updated":"20240612131629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240612131629-jgucu8f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131629-jgucu8f","updated":"20240612131629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.《神农本草经》：蛴螬，生河内平泽及人家积粪草中；取无时；反行者良。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131629-5a9cj7w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131629-5a9cj7w","updated":"20240612131629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《本草图经》：蛴螬，今处处有之。《尔雅》所谓FEI，蛴螬。郭璞云，在粪土中者是也。而诸朽木中蠹虫，形亦相似，但洁白于粪土中者，即《尔雅》所云：蝤蛴，蝎；又云：蝎；又云：蝎，桑虫。郭云在木中虽通名蝎，所在异者是此也。苏恭以为入药当用木中者，乃与《本经》云生积粪草中相戾矣。有名未用中自有桑虫条，桑虫即也，与此主疗殊别。今"}]},{"ID":"20240612131629-1pqr8sc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131629-1pqr8sc","updated":"20240612131629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240612131629-uqiqeuj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131629-uqiqeuj","updated":"20240612131629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 药材基源：为鳃金龟科动物东北大黑鳃金电及其近缘动物的幼虫。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131629-evkd3lh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131629-evkd3lh","updated":"20240612131629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：Holotrichia diomphalia Bates"}]},{"ID":"20240612131629-ecpofc9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131629-ecpofc9","updated":"20240612131629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采收和储藏：5-8月间翻士捕捉，洗净，用沸水烫死，晒干或烘干。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131629-dszc1o3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131629-dszc1o3","updated":"20240612131629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生境分布"}]},{"ID":"20240612131629-h40zaqg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131629-h40zaqg","updated":"20240612131629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 生态环境：成虫栖于土中昼伏夜出，幼虫栖于3-6cm深的土内，成虫和幼虫均为植物性。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131629-bm7lt13","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131629-bm7lt13","updated":"20240612131629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"资源分布：全国大部分地区均有分布。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131629-5eeeshr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131629-5eeeshr","updated":"20240612131629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原形态"}]},{"ID":"20240612131629-das8amd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131629-das8amd","updated":"20240612131629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 东北大黑鳃金龟，体长椭圆形，黑褐色，有光泽，体长16.2-21mm。头部密布刻点。触角黄褐色，10节，呈膝状弯曲，前胸背面有细刻点。鞘翅有纵隆线各3-4条，前足外侧有尖齿3个，内侧有一端棘，跗节末端节最长，爪1 对，呈叉状。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131629-g5c84fb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131629-g5c84fb","updated":"20240612131629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状"}]},{"ID":"20240612131629-l7d20ct","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131629-l7d20ct","updated":"20240612131629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 性状鉴别，虫体呈长圆柱形，多弯曲成半环状，长3-4cm，宽0.6-1.2cm。黄褐色、棕黄色或类白色。全体有轮节，头部较小，棕褐色，胸部有足3对，短而细。体轻，体壳薄，硬而脆，易破碎，体内呈空泡状。气微臭，味微咸。以完整、条大、色黄者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131629-f0o1d2n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131629-f0o1d2n","updated":"20240612131629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"化学成分"}]},{"ID":"20240612131629-kfm1uqx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131629-kfm1uqx","updated":"20240612131629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 蛋白质、脂肪和多种微量元素。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131629-aixtotw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131629-aixtotw","updated":"20240612131629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药理作用"}]},{"ID":"20240612131629-tzvswfi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131629-tzvswfi","updated":"20240612131629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 蛴螬水浸液1∶1000以上能兴奋离体兔子宫；1∶100能抑制离体兔肠管。1∶10000浓度对兔冠状血管、离体兔耳血管、蟾蜍肺血管皆有收缩作用；更高浓度(1∶1000以上)还能收缩蟾蜍内服血管。大剂量有利尿作用，但对血压无影响(急性兔试验)。1∶1000浓度能兴奋离体心脏，浓度更高则导致舒张期停止。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131629-e7oihr7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131629-e7oihr7","updated":"20240612131629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炮制"}]},{"ID":"20240612131629-nb213z3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131629-nb213z3","updated":"20240612131629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 筛去泥土，洗净晒干。《雷公炮炙论》：阴干后与糯米同炒，待米焦黑为度。去口畔并身上肉毛，作三、四截，碾成粉用之。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131629-b71cvp8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131629-b71cvp8","updated":"20240612131629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240612131629-jqowr4x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131629-jqowr4x","updated":"20240612131629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 肝经"}]},{"ID":"20240612131629-fvmdtpe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131629-fvmdtpe","updated":"20240612131629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240612131629-bexs4k2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131629-bexs4k2","updated":"20240612131629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 味咸；性微温；有毒"}]},{"ID":"20240612131629-9ud6qqh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131629-9ud6qqh","updated":"20240612131629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意"}]},{"ID":"20240612131629-n77i5q6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131629-n77i5q6","updated":"20240612131629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 体弱者及孕妇禁服。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131629-78t10wa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131629-78t10wa","updated":"20240612131629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240612131629-ygd86dq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131629-ygd86dq","updated":"20240612131629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 破瘀；散结；止痛；解毒。主血瘀经闭，症瘕；折伤瘀痛；痛风；破伤风；喉痹；痈肿；丹毒"}]},{"ID":"20240612131629-kwh03o3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131629-kwh03o3","updated":"20240612131629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240612131629-11227q8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131629-11227q8","updated":"20240612131629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服：研末，2-5g；或入丸、散。外用：适量，研末调敷，或用汁涂。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131629-3q8uwoo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131629-3q8uwoo","updated":"20240612131629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"复方"}]},{"ID":"20240612131629-fzya09p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131629-fzya09p","updated":"20240612131629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①治白虎风疼痛，昼静夜发： 蛴螬七枚(研烂)，甘草(炙，末，炒)五钱，没药(研)、乳香(研)各炒一钱。上四味同研烂，分二服，每服煎酒一盏，二、三沸，调下，不计时。(《圣济总录》蛴螬散)②治破伤风： 蛴螬虫一个，将脊背捏注，俟它口中吐水，就擦抹在疮口上，觉麻，身上汗出。 (《婴童百问》)③治喉痹： 蛴螬汁，点喉中。(《续传信方》)③ 治痈疽痔漏恶疮及小儿丹： 末蛴螬敷上。(《子母秘录》)⑤治沈唇： 干蛴螬烧末，和猪脂，临卧敷之。(《千金方》)"}]},{"ID":"20240612131629-izfbphd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131629-izfbphd","updated":"20240612131629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"临床应用"}]},{"ID":"20240612131629-0wm59qn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131629-0wm59qn","updated":"20240612131629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 治疗破伤风。将蛴螬倒置(头向下)， 让其自然吐出黄水(如急用，可剪去蛴螬尾，黄水随即流出)。取黄水搽在伤口上(可使伤口麻木，身上出汗)；重症者可将黄水滴入酒中，炖热内服，以使出汗；牙关紧闭者，可用蛴螬水涂擦牙龈。亦可将蛴螬捣烂如泥，外敷伤口，干后即换；或以蛴螬10个，焙干为末，分2次用黄酒送服(小儿酌减)。上述方法每多合并使用。经治14例，结果痊愈11例，死亡3例。有效病例均在15-30分钟张口自如，喉痉挛消失或减轻，口腔分泌物显着减少，能吞咽食物和药物。服药后抽搐虽能减轻，但尚不能制止，仍需配合其他方法治疗。3例死亡者均因年老体弱，并有心肺功能不良。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131629-ipkejpx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131629-ipkejpx","updated":"20240612131629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"各家论述"}]},{"ID":"20240612131629-9zro9zi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131629-9zro9zi","updated":"20240612131629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.《纲目》：蛴螬，《本事方》治筋急，养血地黄丸中用之，取其治血瘀痹也。陈氏《经验方》云：盛冲母失明，取蛴螬蒸熟食，目即开。与《本经》治目中青翳白膜，《药性论》汁滴目中去翳障之说相合。《婴童百问》治破伤风，又符疗骨折、敷恶疮、金疮内塞、主血、止痛之说也。盖此药能行血分，散结滞，故能治以上诸病。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131629-fxeafa8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131629-fxeafa8","updated":"20240612131629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《长沙药解》：蛴螬，能化瘀血，最消块。《金匮》大黄ZHE虫丸用之，治虚劳腹满，内有干血，以其破瘀而化积也。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131629-8shjxgo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131629-8shjxgo","updated":"20240612131629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.《本经》：主恶血血瘀痹气，破折血在胁下坚满痛，月闭，目中淫肤、青翳白膜。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131629-k8honc4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131629-k8honc4","updated":"20240612131629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.《别录》：疗吐血在胸腹不去及破骨折血结，金疮内塞，产后中寒，下乳汁。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131629-glqqr5u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131629-glqqr5u","updated":"20240612131629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.《药性论》：汁滴目中，去翳障，主血，止痛。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131629-i8fu6gf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131629-i8fu6gf","updated":"20240612131629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6.《本草拾遗》：主赤白游疹，疹擦破，碎蛴螬取计涂之。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131629-uuxjh6l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131629-uuxjh6l","updated":"20240612131629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7.《日华子本草》：可敷恶疮。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131629-sl5w01c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131629-sl5w01c","updated":"20240612131629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240612131629-g1vvcjp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131629-g1vvcjp","updated":"20240612131629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240612131630-kufn9p4","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612131630-kufn9p4"}},{"ID":"20240612131631-bcgu8zx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131631-bcgu8zx"}}]}